    "Notes on LLM fine-tuning, inference, model serving, agent systems, and machine learning infrastructure.": "Anmerkungen zu LLM Fine-Tuning, Inferenz, Modelldienst, Agentensystemen und Machine-Learning-Infrastruktur.",
    "Notes on fine-tuning, inference, model serving, agent systems, and ML infrastructure.": "Anmerkungen zu Feinsteuerung, Inferenz, Modelldienst, Agentensystemen und ML-Infrastruktur.",
