    "Engineering Notes | Abhiram Sharma": "Technische notities | Abhiram Sharma",
    "Engineering notes from Abhiram Sharma on LLM fine-tuning, inference, model serving, agent systems, and machine learning infrastructure.": "Technische notities van Abhiram Sharma over LLM-finetuning, inferentie, modelserving, agentsystemen en infrastructuur voor machine learning.",
